sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Straight lines which join the ends of equal and parallel straight lines in the same directions are themselves equal and parallel.
----
proof:

Let {AB} and {CD} be equal and parallel, and let the straight lines {AC} and {BD} join them at their ends in the same directions.

I say that {AC} and {BD} are also equal and parallel.

